WEBVTT

1
00:00:08.049 --> 00:00:13.068
Intro: Nine engines
Opened the closed-loop demo on a public practice storefront with on-screen voiceover cards for every engine.
Value: Buyers can follow the story without reading code.

2
00:00:13.068 --> 00:00:18.080
Engine 01: Impact
Ranked the cart/checkout PR and selected 1 must-run spec(s); skipped marketing footer.
Value: Runs only high-blast-radius tests per change set.

3
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.259
Engine 02: Regression Memory
Matched 1 prior fingerprint(s); kept the guard spec in the run set.
Value: Stops the same pricing defect from shipping twice.

4
00:00:21.259 --> 00:00:33.032
Journey: Sign-up
Completed account creation with ephemeral fake credentials.
Value: Covers real SaaS onboarding paths.

5
00:00:33.032 --> 00:00:43.518
Engine 03: Self-Healing (search)
Healed stale #submit-search-legacy-v1 via css-current-submit.
Value: Cuts locator maintenance; keeps pipelines green on UI renames.

6
00:00:43.518 --> 00:00:54.489
Engine 03: Self-Healing (Add to cart)
Healed #add-to-cart-btn-legacy via text-fallback; 3rd attempt blocked by guardrails.
Value: Self-heal is capped — no silent infinite retries, no false greens.

7
00:00:54.489 --> 00:00:59.503
Engine 04: Bug Hunter
Confirmed pricing regression expected Rs. 500 vs observed Rs. 250.
Value: Catches revenue-breaking math bugs with exact asserts.

8
00:00:59.503 --> 00:01:04.727
Engine 05: Proof Artifacts
Generated 3 Proof Artifacts (schema 1.0.0) including heals and the pricing defect.
Value: Every finding ships as actionable evidence.

9
00:01:04.727 --> 00:01:09.739
Engine 06: Quality Gate
Aggregated gate=BLOCK_DEPLOY from Proof Artifacts.
Value: One proof-backed deploy verdict.

10
00:01:09.739 --> 00:01:14.751
Engine 07: Ticket-to-Gate
Closed loop mirrors ticket → runnable spec → heal → gate (proven offline by demo:ticket-to-gate).
Value: A ticket becomes a ship/block call with evidence attached.

11
00:01:14.751 --> 00:01:20.263
Engine 08: Sprint Trend
Flagged chronic-heal pattern as advisory escalation (inventory suggestion, not auto-commit).
Value: Makes deferred locator debt visible across sprints.

12
00:01:20.263 --> 00:01:26.277
Engine 09: Governance
Enforced max-2 heal budget and deny-by-default scope policy; assertion softening banned.
Value: Trust & governance is mechanism, not marketing copy.

13
00:01:26.277 --> 00:01:31.277
Outro
Closed loop finished with gate=BLOCK_DEPLOY.
Value: Certainty, verified.

